{"t":"Poison Gas","s":"poison-gas-1aa42","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Poison_Gas_c58dd6.gif","q":6,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> <a href=\"#/wiki/Slime%20%28Liquid%29\">Slime (Liquid)</a>, Earth Damage, and Poisoned </i> </span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Poison Gas</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Poison Gas\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poison_Gas_c58dd6.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Magical Effects<br/>Fields</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lightcolor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Light</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #66ff66; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span><span style=\"margin: 0 0 0 0.4em;\">2 sqm</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">May 20, 1998<br/>Beta 4.0</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20141116213457&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poison_Gas_c58dd6.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  poison gas.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Can be found anywhere outside of <a href=\"#/wiki/Protection%20Zone\">Protection Zones</a>, but more common in swampy areas.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>By stepping on one of these you will take 5 earth damage and get the Poisoned special condition for 100 hitpoints (totaling 105 damage). The poisoned condition ticks for 4 turns of 5 damage, 5 turns of 4 damage, 7 turns of 3 damage, 10 turns of 2 damage, and 19 rounds of 1 damage. Its effects can be cured by the <a href=\"#/wiki/Cure%20Poison\">Antidote</a> spell or <a href=\"#/wiki/Cure%20Poison%20Rune\">Antidote Runes</a>, and the gas can be removed by using a <a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field%20Rune\">Destroy Field Rune</a> on it.\n</p><p>Looks the same as Plant Poison.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/captain-iglues-treasure-quest\">Captain Iglues Treasure Quest</a></li><li>Darkfield</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Defiler\">Defiler</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field%20Rune\">Destroy Field Rune</a></li><li>Duplicate Sprites</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dworc%20Voodoomaster\">Dworc Voodoomaster</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Egg%20%28Creature%29\">Egg (Creature)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Exotic%20Cave%20Spider\">Exotic Cave Spider</a></li><li>Field Runes</li><li>Fields</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spider</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/goblin-merchant-quest\">Goblin Merchant Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/katana-quest\">Katana Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/kingdom-of-kormarak-quest\">Kingdom of Kormarak Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Merlkin\">Merlkin</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/newhaven-legion-helmet-quest\">Newhaven Legion Helmet Quest</a></li><li>Plant Poison</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Bomb%20Rune\">Poison Bomb Rune</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Field\">Poison Field</a></li><li>Poison Field Rune</li><li>Poison Gas (Neutral)</li><li>Poisoned</li><li>Rookgaard Graveyards</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Scarab\">Scarab</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Slime%20%28Liquid%29\">Slime (Liquid)</a></li><li>Smoke</li><li>Special Flask (Slime)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Old%20Widow